WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.120 --> 00:00:01.780
- [Announcer] This Great
Big Story was made possible

00:00:01.780 --> 00:00:04.860
by Wells Fargo, established 1852,

00:00:04.860 --> 00:00:07.300
re-established 2018.

00:00:07.300 --> 00:00:09.420
- [Narrator] Located in Altenburg, Austria

00:00:09.420 --> 00:00:11.070
is a Benedictine abbey

00:00:11.070 --> 00:00:13.083
with an unusually beautiful crypt.

00:00:20.680 --> 00:00:22.590
The abbey is filled with well-known areas,

00:00:22.590 --> 00:00:25.050
such as the striking
marble room, the library,

00:00:25.050 --> 00:00:27.670
the chapel and the medieval monastery.

00:00:27.670 --> 00:00:29.970
However, the one area that stands out

00:00:29.970 --> 00:00:31.323
is the abbey's crypt.

00:00:32.508 --> 00:00:33.380
(upbeat music)

00:00:33.380 --> 00:00:36.620
Crypts are often dark,
subterranean homes of the dead,

00:00:36.620 --> 00:00:38.370
but this crypt is bright,

00:00:38.370 --> 00:00:40.823
and its walls are adorned
with beautiful art.

00:00:43.000 --> 00:00:44.630
The detailed frescos were painted

00:00:44.630 --> 00:00:47.040
by Austrian artist Paul Troger

00:00:47.040 --> 00:00:49.200
in the 18th century.

00:00:49.200 --> 00:00:51.780
At a distance, the imagery appears cheery.

00:00:51.780 --> 00:00:54.373
However, death is in the details.

00:00:56.900 --> 00:00:59.270
One wall features a
skeleton holding an arrow

00:00:59.270 --> 00:01:03.240
aimed at cherubs, two
already slain at his feet.

00:01:03.240 --> 00:01:06.520
Intricate images of Roman
gods in skeleton form

00:01:06.520 --> 00:01:09.093
are also painted within massive murals.

00:01:11.430 --> 00:01:15.250
Altenburg Abbey was built in
1144, but has been the site

00:01:15.250 --> 00:01:18.200
of numerous invasions throughout history.

00:01:18.200 --> 00:01:21.480
In 1645, a Swedish attack rendered it

00:01:21.480 --> 00:01:23.163
in need of severe repair.

00:01:24.770 --> 00:01:26.370
But despite these trials,

00:01:26.370 --> 00:01:28.200
the abbey has remained active

00:01:28.200 --> 00:01:31.653
and is a unique experience
for all that come to see it.

00:01:32.817 --> 00:01:35.567
(relaxing music)

